<title>NETHERLANDS: SGS Europe cocoa stock estimates down at end-July.</title>
<headline>SGS Europe cocoa stock estimates down at end-July.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>SGS Warehouse Services gave the following estimates of cocoa in store as of end of July/early August. All figures in tonnes.</p>
<p>		   Total	 Of which for the buffer stock</p>
<p>AMSTERDAM	513,000     25,962.578 (inc 7,483.627 forw sales)</p>
<p>HAMBURG/BREMEN 123,250     15,508.418</p>
<p>ANTWERP	  124,933	1,449.828 (all forw sales)</p>
<p>UK (ALL PORTS)  53,500</p>
<p>ROTTERDAM	 13,000	2,190.095 (all forw sales)</p>
<p>The following are changes to month earlier levels:</p>
<p>AMSTERDAM     DOWN 17,000	   HAMBURG/BREMEN     DOWN 4,750</p>
<p>ANTWERP	 DOWN  2,010	   UK (ALL PORTS)     DOWN 2,250</p>
<p>ROTTERDAM     DOWN    750</p>
<p>--Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
